<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 2.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 2	Aug 30	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  236.780     236.860     237,040   -0.11 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.635     160.100     165.490   -3.54 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.676	46.786	48.410   -3.58 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  369.880     368.840     366.280    0.98 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  196.395     197.525     206.030   -4.68 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.395     142.790     147.886   -3.71 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.664	15.665	14.975    4.60 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.880     217.980     230.135   -5.76 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.200     301.200     303.640   -0.80 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.890	 1.893	 1.939   -2.53 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.555	 1.575   -1.14 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
